# Copy to .env (gitignored) and fill in. Used only by local tooling, never shipped in the IPK.
# Movie of the Night / Streaming Availability API key. Get one from the Developers Platform
# (https://www.movieofthenight.com/about/api, keys start with "motn-key-", sent to
# api.movieofthenight.com/v4); a RapidAPI key also works and is sent to RapidAPI instead.
MOTN_API_KEY=
